		{
			"id": "aWonqBRS",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1845.675,
			"y": 935.7,
			"width": 705,
			"height": 585,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bB8",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1186155876,
			"version": 782,
			"versionNonce": 1514389852,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1794751579611,
			"created": 1794751231947,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Flow 3 - Cancel Subscription\n1) Validate JWT + ownership (authZ)\nTX:\n2) Lock subscription (or version CAS)\n3) If canceled already -> idempotent success\n4) Set auto_renew=false, cancel_at_period_end\n5) Retain ACTIVE through paid_through/end_at\n6) Commit; return updated status\nCancel vs Renewal Race:\n7) Renewal rechecks cancel flag before charge\n8) In-flight PSP charge cannot be uncalled\n9) Honor charge or refund per explicit policy\n\nFlow 4 - Voucher\n1) Discount: reserve before payment in TX;\n   release reservation on failed payment\n2) Reward: outbox after invoice PAID\n3) Kafka worker handles duplicate events\n4) Claim pre-created voucher atomically:\n   UPDATE ... WHERE status='NEW' RETURNING\n5) Record redemption and retry safely\n\nFlow 5 - Check Status\n1) Authenticate + authorize subscription owner\n2) Read Postgres (primary if critical)\n3) Cache/replica only with accepted staleness",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"baseFontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Flow 3 - Cancel Subscription\n1) Validate JWT + ownership (authZ)\nTX:\n2) Lock subscription (or version CAS)\n3) If canceled already -> idempotent success\n4) Set auto_renew=false, cancel_at_period_end\n5) Retain ACTIVE through paid_through/end_at\n6) Commit; return updated status\nCancel vs Renewal Race:\n7) Renewal rechecks cancel flag before charge\n8) In-flight PSP charge cannot be uncalled\n9) Honor charge or refund per explicit policy\n\nFlow 4 - Voucher\n1) Discount: reserve before payment in TX;\n   release reservation on failed payment\n2) Reward: outbox after invoice PAID\n3) Kafka worker handles duplicate events\n4) Claim pre-created voucher atomically:\n   UPDATE ... WHERE status='NEW' RETURNING\n5) Record redemption and retry safely\n\nFlow 5 - Check Status\n1) Authenticate + authorize subscription owner\n2) Read Postgres (primary if critical)\n3) Cache/replica only with accepted staleness",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
