			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Deep Dive / Invariants:\n- 1 logical checkout -> at most 1 provider charge\n- 1 invoice per subscription billing period\n- 1 provider webhook/event may arrive many times\n- status transitions must be legal + idempotent\n- NEVER hold SQL locks while calling PSP\n- failed charge does not extend paid_through\n- cancellations racing with charges need policy",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"baseFontSize": 18,
